{
  "id": "5a5b7c8d9e0f1a2b",
  "name": "deploykit - autofix dispatch",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## deploykit - autofix dispatch\n\nOptional post-triage sub-workflow. Called by any inlet that produced a NEW Linear ticket for a structured incident (Sentry, PagerDuty, or anything else with a stack trace) and wants a draft-PR autofix attempt.\n\nFires `repository_dispatch` at the configured target repo's GitHub Actions. The Action runs a cloud coding agent (Cursor Cloud Agent by default) and opens a **draft** PR whose body starts with `Fixes <linear_identifier>` so Linear's native GitHub integration links it back.\n\n**Input contract** (from caller):\n```\n{\n  linear_identifier: 'PLT-142',\n  linear_issue_url:  'https://linear.app/…',\n  linear_title:      'OCR fails on rotated scans',\n  incident: {\n    source, customer, error_class, message,\n    file, line, environment, stack_frames, incident_url\n  }\n}\n```\nReturns `{ dispatched: true, event_type, target_repo }`.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. **Config**: set `github_owner`, `github_repo`, and (optional) `event_type`.\n2. **GitHub Dispatch**: attach a GitHub credential with `repo` scope (repository_dispatch needs write on Actions).\n3. Copy `autofix-action-template.yml` into the target repo as `.github/workflows/deploykit-autofix.yml`; set its secrets.\n4. From the calling inlet, flip `autofix_enabled=true` and point its *Trigger Autofix* node at this workflow.\n\nDon't run this standalone; import it, then have inlets call it.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 500
      },
      "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555500",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-60, -680]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555501",
      "name": "Autofix Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "name": "github_owner",
              "value": "REPLACE_WITH_GITHUB_OWNER",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
              "name": "github_repo",
              "value": "REPLACE_WITH_GITHUB_REPO",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
              "name": "event_type",
              "value": "deploykit-autofix",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555502",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://api.github.com/repos/{{ $('Config').first().json.github_owner }}/{{ $('Config').first().json.github_repo }}/dispatches",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "githubApi",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Accept",
              "value": "application/vnd.github+json"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-GitHub-Api-Version",
              "value": "2022-11-28"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"event_type\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Config').first().json.event_type) }},\n  \"client_payload\": {\n    \"linear_identifier\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.linear_identifier) }},\n    \"linear_issue_url\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.linear_issue_url) }},\n    \"linear_title\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.linear_title) }},\n    \"incident\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.incident) }}\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555503",
      "name": "GitHub Dispatch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [460, 0],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000,
      "credentials": {
        "githubApi": {
          "id": "CONFIGURE_ME",
          "name": "GitHub account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
